# org-target: docs/10-19-design/10-architecture/10.15-scheme-owned-rust-mechanisms-and-development-evidence.org::#scheme-rust-mechanism-owners
# render-layout: elk; theme: 0; pad: 24; timeout: 30
direction: down
classes: {
  knowledge: {style.fill: "#EAF2FF"; style.stroke: "#315B8A"; style.border-radius: 10}
  active: {style.fill: "#E6F5F3"; style.stroke: "#19756C"; style.border-radius: 10}
  limit: {style.fill: "#FFF2DD"; style.stroke: "#9B6C25"; style.border-radius: 10}
}
reference: "Tokio reference study\nSource mechanisms / atomic stages / trace mapping\nBroadcast and watch are separate future subjects\nNo imported acceptance, TLA pipeline or gold" {class: knowledge}
library: "Core / Scheme publication: rust-resources\nPOO Catalog rules / resource Contracts / dependencies\nShared method observer + independent oracle\nNo gateway-domain alias or copied module" {class: knowledge}
agent: "LLM-based AI agent during development\nDiscover knowledge and actual missing premises\nPropose ownership / scheduling / layout alternatives\nChoose evidence requests and interpret counters\nExplicit factors; no automatic AST-to-rule extractor" {class: active}
applications: "Independent POO Profiles / Scenarios\nresource-lifecycle: minimal native mechanism\ngateway-review: application example\nBoth bind the same Library and Evidence owners" {class: knowledge}
model: "Source-informed QNT / Lean\nQNT: five jobs, capacity / queue one, 352 states\nSeparate early-release initializer and step\nLean: conditional 128 / 256 <= 256\nNo whole-program refinement or RSS theorem" {class: active}
native: "Actual Tokio / Rayon crate\nSource + Cargo.lock + effective metadata\nM01 normal / M02 pending-acquire cancellation\nM03 receiver loss / M04 caller abort\nM05 full cleanup / M06 incorrect permit lifetime" {class: active}
observe: "Existing Core ProcessScript + Scheme observer\nActual argv / bounded process completion / logs\nBinary + dependency source and input hashes\nIndependent stable-cut / order / ownership oracle\nTool failure is not semantic counterevidence" {class: active}
exchange: "Existing native ASCENT trajectory / clue exchange\nIssuer-owned result validation\nActual observation and method-review references\nJSON alone cannot create an issued result" {class: active}
evidence: "resource-evidence: native Evidence DSL / Session\nObligation / support / counter / pending / T-use\nExact source / runtime / workload / oracle footprint\nRetain historical witnesses and frozen cuts" {class: active}
change: "Change and development feedback\nSource edit: fresh native correspondence\nPayload change: reuse model, recheck Lean + native\nLock / artifact mutation: refuse stale validation\nAgent chooses next alternative from actual evidence" {class: knowledge}
limits: "Separate remaining acceptance\nBroadcast/watch internals, weak memory, panic/shutdown\nComplete source refinement / general progress\nMatched throughput / p99 / RSS / hardware evidence\nExisting SDLC policy and effect authorization" {class: limit}
reference -> model: "research questions; no imported authority"
library -> applications
agent -> applications: "selected investigation"
applications -> model
applications -> native
model -> observe
native -> observe
observe -> exchange -> evidence
library -> evidence: "authored rule semantics"
evidence -> change
change -> limits: "unclosed engineering obligations"
